WEBVTT


00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:33.168
Tell your boss, this happens again,
I'll be knocking on his door.


00:02:53.084 --> 00:02:54.126
Go on.


00:02:56.293 --> 00:02:57.668
Go on, son. Yes!


00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:01.668
Yes!


00:03:03.918 --> 00:03:05.168
Ready for this, son?


00:03:30.293 --> 00:03:31.543
Right, you want this?


00:03:32.709 --> 00:03:35.001
Green Street Elite, that's who we are, mate.


00:03:56.626 --> 00:03:57.834
Get up!


00:04:09.918 --> 00:04:11.543
MAN; Finish him Off!


00:04:39.501 --> 00:04:40.501
Hello.


00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:46.251
Why, what's happened?


00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:01.459
I'm on my way.


00:05:33.126 --> 00:05:35.168
<i>Come on, Joey,
show us what you got.</i>


00:05:35.751 --> 00:05:36.793
Double jab.


00:05:38.751 --> 00:05:39.918
That's it.


00:05:41.418 --> 00:05:42.584
<i>Great, mate.</i>


00:05:43.834 --> 00:05:44.959
<i>Harder, son!</i>


00:05:45.543 --> 00:05:48.043
<i>You and me, Danny,
we're a breed of champions.</i>


00:05:51.793 --> 00:05:53.376
Jab, cross hook.


00:05:54.043 --> 00:05:55.168
Nice, bruv.


00:05:55.709 --> 00:05:57.043
<i>And again, come on.</i>


00:05:59.959 --> 00:06:01.334
<i>Jab cross, up cross.</i>


00:06:02.626 --> 00:06:03.709
<i>Yes, bruv.</i>


00:06:14.334 --> 00:06:16.043
<i>Come on, Joe, keep your guard up.</i>


00:06:22.293 --> 00:06:24.418
<i>That's power. One more time.</i>


00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:25.793
Cross hook, cross.


00:06:26.293 --> 00:06:29.459
Come on, Joey, on your toes, mate. Let's go.


00:06:30.043 --> 00:06:31.501
<i>Jab cross, hook cross.</i>


00:06:33.001 --> 00:06:34.626
<i>You're a fucking winner, son.</i>


00:06:40.376 --> 00:06:42.584
<i>Keeping going like this,
you could be a pro one day.</i>


00:06:42.751 --> 00:06:44.459
<i>Pistol said I'm quicker than you.</i>


00:06:44.543 --> 00:06:46.709
<i>Maybe. Keep on
the straight and narrow,</i>


00:06:47.084 --> 00:06:49.459
<i>concentrate on fighting, train hard,</i>


00:06:50.001 --> 00:06:51.793
<i>you'll be a lot better than me.</i>


00:06:52.793 --> 00:06:54.709
<i>You gonna coach me in the ring, Dan?</i>


00:06:55.043 --> 00:06:57.876
<i>Yeah, I'll be in your corner, son.
You know it.</i>


00:07:43.209 --> 00:07:46.084
<i>I know we'll always be on top
cos you're watching my back.</i>


00:07:47.668 --> 00:07:48.918
<i>I love you, brother.</i>


00:08:23.168 --> 00:08:25.959
Oh, God.


00:08:27.293 --> 00:08:29.376
- It's all right, Mum.


00:10:14.918 --> 00:10:16.334
It's just tragic.


00:10:17.668 --> 00:10:19.834
- Poor lad.
-It's not a nice way to go, is it?


00:10:24.834 --> 00:10:26.334
My sweet Joey.


00:10:27.876 --> 00:10:29.376
Be all right, Mum.


00:10:29.709 --> 00:10:32.418
I want you to know,
I am going to do everything in my power


00:10:32.501 --> 00:10:35.126
to put away the people that did this.


00:10:37.668 --> 00:10:40.084
He would have been
World Champion, you know.


00:10:40.168 --> 00:10:41.959
Joey went pro?


00:10:42.043 --> 00:10:43.959
Yeah, mate, he was flying.


00:10:44.751 --> 00:10:48.043
- Not that you'd seen him fight in years.
- Oh, don't start, Mum.


00:10:49.334 --> 00:10:50.793
He missed you.


00:10:55.001 --> 00:10:57.501
- Lizzie, someone's at the door.
- I'll get it.


00:11:02.126 --> 00:11:03.834
Come on, Liz, it's OK. It's OK.


00:11:11.918 --> 00:11:15.334
I'm Gilly, this is Big John.
We were friends of Joey's.


00:11:16.543 --> 00:11:19.043
We're just here to pay our respects.


00:11:21.918 --> 00:11:24.918
Listen, why don't you come down
the Abbey one night, have a beer with us.


00:11:33.709 --> 00:11:37.168
Anything I do, no, they bloody can't.
It's too late now.


00:11:37.834 --> 00:11:39.501
Anyone important?


00:11:41.084 --> 00:11:43.959
I need to clear my head.
Do you want to do one?


00:11:59.251 --> 00:12:01.084
Sorry I didn't make it to the wedding, mate.


00:12:01.168 --> 00:12:04.626
It's all right.
At least you got out of this shithole.


00:12:08.959 --> 00:12:11.876
I told Joey the GSE
was a fucking mug's game.


00:12:13.376 --> 00:12:17.751
Yeah, well, you left quite the legacy.
What boy wouldn't want to be a part of that?


00:12:17.834 --> 00:12:20.418
I should have taken him with me, Vic.


00:12:20.501 --> 00:12:22.293
It's not your fault.


00:12:24.126 --> 00:12:25.876
So what happened to him then?


00:12:25.959 --> 00:12:27.959
We don't have much intel on it.


00:12:28.043 --> 00:12:29.709
What's that mean?


00:12:29.793 --> 00:12:31.668
It means it's more organised now.


00:12:31.751 --> 00:12:34.918
Hooligans done some pretty heavy sentences.
No one wants do to a 10-stretch.


00:12:35.001 --> 00:12:37.751
Oh, come on, Vic.
You trying to tell me it's all stopped?


00:12:37.834 --> 00:12:40.876
Look, they're not smashing shit out
of each other on street corners any more.


00:12:41.168 --> 00:12:44.668
Right, and in the meantime,
my fucking brother's dead!


00:12:45.209 --> 00:12:46.876
Yeah, well, the crime stats look good,


00:12:46.959 --> 00:12:49.126
and that's all my guvnors
give a toss about, so...


00:12:53.793 --> 00:12:56.293
Guess I better get down the Abbey then,
see what's what.


00:12:56.376 --> 00:12:57.459
You'll do nothing of the sort.


00:12:57.543 --> 00:12:58.876
What, you want me to sit round here
and do nothing?


00:12:58.959 --> 00:13:01.834
Yeah, if you want me to lock up who did it.


00:13:41.209 --> 00:13:43.501
-- Shh.


00:13:43.584 --> 00:13:45.001
It's all right.


00:13:55.293 --> 00:13:57.918
I didn't think you were serious, Danny.


00:14:01.084 --> 00:14:02.709
Why don't you come with me?


00:14:02.793 --> 00:14:04.334
I won't turn my back on the firm.


00:14:04.418 --> 00:14:06.084
Oh, fuck all that.


00:14:06.168 --> 00:14:08.501
Why don't you concentrate
on real fighting and going pro?


00:14:08.584 --> 00:14:11.793
Not fucking running around
bashing up people with the GSE.


00:14:11.876 --> 00:14:13.209
It's a mug's game.


00:14:13.293 --> 00:14:15.501
How can you say that?
That's your firm, Danny.


00:14:15.584 --> 00:14:18.084
And I don't fucking want it any more, all right?


00:14:18.168 --> 00:14:20.334
I want to get a real life,


00:14:20.418 --> 00:14:22.834
wanna fucking make something of myself.


00:14:22.918 --> 00:14:24.126
Yeah, Mum?


00:14:28.543 --> 00:14:30.209
- Go on.
- Oh...


00:14:30.709 --> 00:14:33.793
Come on. You take care of yourself, all right?


00:14:35.293 --> 00:14:36.793
You, too, Mum.


00:14:39.834 --> 00:14:44.918
Look, Joey, you can be West Ham
without being on the firm.


00:14:47.293 --> 00:14:49.876
Why don't you come with me, all right?


00:14:50.918 --> 00:14:53.459
We'll do it together, I'll train ya.


00:14:56.834 --> 00:14:59.501
You're nothing but a fucking coward.


00:16:19.584 --> 00:16:23.293
What the fuck's he doing? Let's go talk to him.


00:16:28.334 --> 00:16:30.584
Two large brandies and a pint.


00:16:30.918 --> 00:16:33.959
It's all right, Molly. This is Danny,
Joey's brother. He's just back for a...


00:16:34.043 --> 00:16:35.376
Two large brandies and a pint.


00:16:36.459 --> 00:16:37.793
All right.


00:16:38.209 --> 00:16:40.793
On me and, uh, I'll have one as well.


00:16:43.334 --> 00:16:45.459
How's the gym going up there, mate?


00:16:45.543 --> 00:16:47.751
Joey never shuts up about it.


00:16:48.418 --> 00:16:50.501
Tough bastards, them Celts.


00:16:57.376 --> 00:16:59.126
Here you are, boys.


00:16:59.793 --> 00:17:01.376
Thank you.


00:17:02.084 --> 00:17:03.709
Ta, darling.


00:17:04.209 --> 00:17:05.459
Everyone!


00:17:07.168 --> 00:17:08.876
Raise your glasses


00:17:09.501 --> 00:17:10.709
to the guvnor, Danny.


00:17:10.793 --> 00:17:12.751
The guvnor, Danny!


00:17:15.709 --> 00:17:17.376
Welcome home, mate.


00:17:20.418 --> 00:17:22.251
How'd the funeral go?


00:17:23.668 --> 00:17:25.084
That's none of your business.


00:17:25.168 --> 00:17:26.876
- He was my best mate, Danny.
- Yeah?


00:17:27.959 --> 00:17:29.168
You could've fooled me.


00:17:29.251 --> 00:17:30.376
Oi!


00:17:31.334 --> 00:17:32.709
Joey's death hit us all.


00:17:32.793 --> 00:17:34.334
Shall we find out how big you really are, John?


00:17:34.418 --> 00:17:35.751
Knock it off, gentlemen.


00:17:35.834 --> 00:17:37.126
It's all right, Molly, I've got it under control.


00:17:37.209 --> 00:17:38.459
Yeah, I wish you fucking did have.


00:17:38.543 --> 00:17:40.501
- You're bang out of order, mate.
- I ain't talking to you.


00:17:41.709 --> 00:17:43.626
I think you should leave.


00:17:44.251 --> 00:17:46.001
Everyone just calm down, eh?


00:17:46.084 --> 00:17:48.543
Let's all take a couple of steps backwards.


00:17:52.293 --> 00:17:56.084
Now, Danny, you're always welcome here,
mate. This was your firm.


00:17:58.209 --> 00:18:00.168
But what is it you want?


00:18:11.501 --> 00:18:12.751
I want to beat Tottenham.


00:18:17.751 --> 00:18:19.959
Molly, keep these drinks
coming, darling. Come on.


00:18:49.543 --> 00:18:51.584
United! United!


00:19:09.959 --> 00:19:12.043
Danny, what the fuck you doing?
You can't have that in here.


00:19:12.126 --> 00:19:13.459
Says who?


00:19:16.834 --> 00:19:18.251
What you fucking looking at?


00:19:19.751 --> 00:19:21.793
I'll fucking see you outside, you wanker.


00:19:21.876 --> 00:19:23.251
- Easy, Danny.
- You're nothing, West Ham.


00:19:23.334 --> 00:19:25.501
I'll carve you like a kipper, you fucking mug.


00:19:25.584 --> 00:19:27.001
You can't get away with that any more, mate.


00:19:27.126 --> 00:19:28.584
Shove your bums up your arse.


00:19:28.668 --> 00:19:29.834
Oh, you fucking want it?


00:19:53.793 --> 00:19:55.001
Fucking hell.


00:21:05.334 --> 00:21:07.376
NAN DOOR CLOSES)


00:21:12.918 --> 00:21:14.376
Come on, out you get.


00:21:25.334 --> 00:21:27.876
- What you doing?


00:21:30.376 --> 00:21:32.001
Go away, old timer.


00:21:32.084 --> 00:21:33.293
What you talking about?


00:21:33.376 --> 00:21:34.376
Jog on.


00:21:38.959 --> 00:21:40.084
NAN DOOR CLOSES)


00:22:20.501 --> 00:22:23.209
I'm sorry about earlier, OK?
That was disrespectful.


00:22:23.876 --> 00:22:25.209
I was bang out of line.


00:22:26.959 --> 00:22:28.793
Better get you a drink then, ain't I?


00:22:34.334 --> 00:22:35.543
It's Molly, right?


00:22:37.168 --> 00:22:39.501
- Yeah.
- Cheers.


00:22:41.876 --> 00:22:43.251
Keep the change.


00:22:43.543 --> 00:22:45.293
Oh, thank you.


00:22:52.418 --> 00:22:53.751
- How we get on?
- Three-nil.


00:22:53.834 --> 00:22:57.668
- Another three points in the bag.
- We keep going like this, we'll make Europe.


00:22:57.751 --> 00:23:00.001
Yeah, shit on Man U on the way.


00:23:00.084 --> 00:23:02.293
Um, can we have a word
out of the way, please?


00:23:02.376 --> 00:23:03.834
Yeah, sure.


00:23:05.043 --> 00:23:06.209
- You all right, boys?
- Drink?


00:23:06.293 --> 00:23:08.084
Yeah, get me something wet, John.


00:23:08.168 --> 00:23:10.876
All right, Molly? Uh, can I have
four lagers please, babe?


00:23:12.126 --> 00:23:14.209
Can you get us four shots as well
while you're at it, please?


00:23:23.584 --> 00:23:25.709
I'm genuinely sorry for what happened to Joey.


00:23:27.209 --> 00:23:31.418
Well, that's the problem, isn't it?
What did happen to him?


00:23:33.376 --> 00:23:37.043
I'm glad your back, Danny.
We ain't the outfit we used to be.


00:23:37.709 --> 00:23:39.459
I need someone to lead us back to the top.


00:23:39.543 --> 00:23:41.043
Who did it?


00:23:43.126 --> 00:23:45.418
I said, who fucking did it?


00:23:45.501 --> 00:23:47.418
You don't think I want to get them
as much as you do?


00:23:47.501 --> 00:23:48.959
Oh, you reckon, do ya?


00:23:49.626 --> 00:23:51.043
How long you here for?


00:23:53.418 --> 00:23:54.834
Let's just say I'm back.


00:23:56.376 --> 00:23:57.543
What the fuck is that?


00:24:03.209 --> 00:24:05.251
Gil, there's about 20 Spurs outside.


00:24:10.501 --> 00:24:12.043
Look at what you've started.


00:24:13.668 --> 00:24:15.084
Right, everybody up.


00:24:15.876 --> 00:24:17.459
- Come on, West Ham!


00:24:39.793 --> 00:24:41.584
You broke the rules, Gilly.


00:24:42.668 --> 00:24:44.709
Come on!


00:24:57.209 --> 00:24:59.334
I'll break his fucking neck.


00:25:40.751 --> 00:25:43.584
Come on!


00:25:51.584 --> 00:25:53.168
Fucking come on!


00:25:56.751 --> 00:25:58.168
ALL;  Guvnor!


00:26:13.084 --> 00:26:15.876
Listen, do me a favour,
keep yourself free tomorrow night.


00:26:16.001 --> 00:26:17.251
All right?


00:26:26.251 --> 00:26:28.709
You must have really upset that lot earlier.


00:26:28.793 --> 00:26:32.334
Well, sometimes an old-fashioned
straightener is the only way.


00:26:32.418 --> 00:26:35.168
- You having another?
- Yeah, please.


00:26:37.209 --> 00:26:39.459
- Hey, Molly.
- Yeah.


00:26:40.126 --> 00:26:42.834
Could I, uh, see you sometime?


00:26:43.834 --> 00:26:45.126
Reckon you can see me now.


00:26:45.834 --> 00:26:47.626
Nah, I mean maybe go out for a drink.


00:26:47.709 --> 00:26:50.834
Drink? I got all the booze
in the world right here.


00:26:51.126 --> 00:26:53.001
- Fucking hell.


00:26:53.084 --> 00:26:55.001
Nah, I don't go out with anyone from the firm.


00:26:55.084 --> 00:26:56.793
Self-imposed rule.


00:26:57.376 --> 00:26:58.668
Oh, right.


00:26:59.168 --> 00:27:02.459
But seeing as you're here on holiday,
it's a bit different, right?


00:27:03.918 --> 00:27:05.209
Yeah, course.


00:27:06.084 --> 00:27:08.126
Come see me when you've sobered up.


00:27:35.376 --> 00:27:37.293
Fucking state of ya.


00:27:37.376 --> 00:27:39.584
I did what I needed to do.


00:27:39.668 --> 00:27:43.334
I told you to stay out of it,
or you'll fuck up my investigation.


00:27:43.418 --> 00:27:47.418
What fucking investigation?
What are you lot even doing down there?


00:27:47.501 --> 00:27:49.626
- I'm trying, mate.
- Try harder!


00:28:00.418 --> 00:28:05.543
Come on, I want you to
prove to me that you've still got it.


00:28:09.543 --> 00:28:10.668
Come on!


00:28:14.293 --> 00:28:16.001
Oh-ho-ho-ho!


00:28:16.834 --> 00:28:17.959
Talk.


00:28:21.959 --> 00:28:24.876
- Gilly wants me to lead the firm.
- You serious?


00:28:24.959 --> 00:28:27.001
Oh, you're interested now,
ain't ya?


00:28:30.209 --> 00:28:32.876
Felt good giving it to
them Tottenham slags though.


00:28:32.959 --> 00:28:35.334
Stop it, or you're gonna
land yourself in trouble.


00:28:35.418 --> 00:28:38.918
Look, somebody knows
what happened to my brother,


00:28:39.001 --> 00:28:41.584
and the only way I'm gonna find out
is if I get back in.


00:29:10.043 --> 00:29:12.334
Fucking hell, Pete,
you're not dead yet?


00:29:13.501 --> 00:29:15.459
That's Pistol Pete to you, boy.


00:29:21.084 --> 00:29:22.668
- You're looking good, son.
- Yeah?


00:29:22.751 --> 00:29:24.168
- Sharp.
- Still doing everything


00:29:24.251 --> 00:29:25.418
-you taught me, that's why.
- Good lad.


00:29:25.501 --> 00:29:27.584
That will keep you fighting fit
till you're an old bastard.


00:29:27.668 --> 00:29:29.626
- Well, you're still here, ain't ya?
- Cheeky sod.


00:29:31.376 --> 00:29:32.751
I'm sorry about Joey.


00:29:34.251 --> 00:29:37.918
- How come you didn't come down?
- Well, you know me, son. I can't do funerals.


00:29:38.501 --> 00:29:40.418
So how was Joe really doing?


00:29:40.501 --> 00:29:42.709
I'd only ever seen one fighter better.


00:29:44.668 --> 00:29:46.084
Morning, ladies.


00:29:46.168 --> 00:29:47.668
- All right, Pistol?
- You all right, geezer?


00:29:47.751 --> 00:29:51.251
Yeah. Anyway, feel free to use the place
as and when you want.


00:29:51.334 --> 00:29:54.084
No, no, no, this is on me.


00:29:54.168 --> 00:29:57.501
Here's your locker key.
You know where the showers are.


00:29:57.584 --> 00:30:01.418
- Cheers, Pete. They working yet?
- Cold taps always have.


00:30:01.876 --> 00:30:03.543
Oh, fucking hell.


00:31:34.751 --> 00:31:36.001
Here he is.


00:31:37.251 --> 00:31:40.668
Molly, get Danny a beer, please, sweetheart?
Round of shots for us.


00:31:40.751 --> 00:31:42.501
- Coming up.
- Thank you.


00:31:44.084 --> 00:31:47.209
- So have you sobered up yet?
- Was I that bad?


00:31:48.501 --> 00:31:51.168
No, I'm just teasing you.
You were quite sweet, actually.


00:31:52.626 --> 00:31:54.251
Well, don't tell that lot, will ya?


00:31:55.876 --> 00:31:57.043
It's our secret.


00:31:57.126 --> 00:31:59.043
Oh, I knew I could trust you.


00:31:59.334 --> 00:32:02.126
Molly, come on.
The boys are getting thirsty over here.


00:32:05.876 --> 00:32:08.001
Molly, come on, darling.


00:32:08.126 --> 00:32:09.584
On its way.


00:32:10.459 --> 00:32:12.084
Go on, your public want you.


00:32:37.876 --> 00:32:39.626
Cheers!


00:32:48.209 --> 00:32:49.251
Come on!


00:33:12.043 --> 00:33:13.668
Oh, she's all right. She's fine.


00:33:14.793 --> 00:33:18.001
- You, I've had enough of your shit.


00:33:24.793 --> 00:33:26.751
- Drink up, were off ski.
- Oh, great.


00:33:56.876 --> 00:33:58.251
What's this prick doing here?


00:34:00.001 --> 00:34:01.084
Easy, Danny.


00:34:05.376 --> 00:34:06.584
All right, Jib?


00:34:08.043 --> 00:34:09.751
Come on, boys, we're up.


00:34:12.418 --> 00:34:15.084
<i>- What the fuck was that?
- I'll show ya.</i>


00:34:25.001 --> 00:34:26.418
This is how it's run now.


00:34:27.168 --> 00:34:30.334
What, everyone being pally?
Sounds sick to me.


00:34:32.334 --> 00:34:35.043
You got nothing, Millwall,
you little fucking slag.


00:34:35.626 --> 00:34:37.959
The rivalry is still there, still got our firms.


00:34:38.876 --> 00:34:40.543
You know, what's the point
of fighting for nothing


00:34:40.626 --> 00:34:43.501
when you get a serious bit
of hurt for your trouble?


00:34:43.584 --> 00:34:45.001
There's been an agreement.


00:34:45.251 --> 00:34:47.793
Keep it clean on the streets
and fight dirty underground.


00:34:48.126 --> 00:34:51.168
We place bets, make money,
settle differences.


00:34:51.751 --> 00:34:53.459
Run like the league, mate.


00:34:54.251 --> 00:34:56.918
Points for a win,
and there is never a fucking draw.


00:34:57.376 --> 00:34:59.126
Goes until it's finished.


